<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομᾰρ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to waste away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ συλλήψεις ἀ. τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. Chor.<i><span class="en">
				p.22
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκμὴν τῶν αἰσθήσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callistr.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὰς τὰς τὸ θυμοειδὲς -ούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					7.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>obliterate</i> from memory, <i><span class="en">
				Chor.
				<u>Milt.</u>
				19
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>waste, wither away, die away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ῥητορικὴ ἐκείνη ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					177b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα ἡδοναὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					328d
				</span></i>
			; of a tranquil death, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; of comets, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομαρανθέντες κατὰ μικρπὸν
					ἠφανίσθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					343b16
				</span></i>
			; of wind, <i>die down,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				367b11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					1.12
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
